<InfoPage title="About Musebox AI Video Guide" kicker="About this publication" description="An independent editorial guide to Musebox AI video generation, image-to-video workflow, consent, privacy, credits, and alternatives."><h2>Our purpose</h2><p>We help adults understand what to test before uploading an image or paying for an AI video tool. Coverage focuses on workflow, motion consistency, credits, source rights, consent, storage, deletion, disclosure, and meaningful differences between platforms.</p><h2>Independence</h2><p>This is not the official Musebox product website. Official links are clearly marked and open the provider’s own site. Features, models, prices, policies, and availability can change, so readers should verify current details before uploading or purchasing.</p><h2>Editorial approach</h2><p>Each article answers a specific production or safety question, uses an original comparison framework, identifies uncertainty, links to primary sources, and displays publication and update dates. We never request private source images for review.</p></InfoPage>
